          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 7:1",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "For he had been forth among the people who were in the land northward, and did preach the word of God unto them, and did prophesy many things unto them;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 7:2",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And they did reject all his words, insomuch that he could not stay among them, but returned again unto the land of his nativity.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "TG Prophets, Rejection of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
