        "reference": "Helaman 7:23",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "For behold, they are more righteous than you, for they have not sinned against that great knowledge which ye have received; therefore the Lord will be merciful unto them; yea, he will lengthen out their days and increase their seed, even when thou shalt be utterly destroyed except thou shalt repent.",
        "footNotes": [
